{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301640","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301640","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1830164001:1":{"text":"내가 다시 한번 널 볼 생각에 몇 년이나 준비해서 겨우 노바리스까지 왔는데! 그런데 너... 너는...!","source_cn":"我准备了这么多年，好不容易才来到诺珐斯，就想着能再见一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76D33344773AF0C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830164002:1":{"text":"...여기서 딴 살림을 차려?!","source_cn":"——你竟然在这边有了新的家庭！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81A74061C98773CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830164003:1":{"text":"로사... 내가 죽은 지 벌써 20년이나 됐어. 난 네가 분명 날 잊었을 거라고 생각했어...","source_cn":"罗莎……我已经去世二十年了，我以为你肯定会忘了我的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x417BD968CCE43EAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830164004:1":{"text":"과거는 놓아줘, 로사... 이제 앞을 보고 살아가야지. 나 같은 죽은 사람 때문에 네 미래를 망치지 마.","source_cn":"放下过去吧，罗莎……你该向前看了。别让我这样一个死人耽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1B50F3467817F0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830164005:1":{"text":"레드...! 어떻게 그런 말을!","source_cn":"雷德……你怎么能说出这样的话？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6950CCFEAF91382B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1830164006:1":{"text":"어, 사실 레드가 아니라 레이드야.","source_cn":"呃，其实我现在已经不叫雷德了，我叫累德。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C8C91C82E470EEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1830164007:1":{"text":"...레이드? 그건 또 무슨 바보 같은 이름이야?","source_cn":"……累德？多么愚蠢的名字！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x634CFD9B64C1E59B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1830164008:1":{"text":"다시는 너 같은 거 보고 싶지 않아! 아니... 죽어서도 다시는 널 만나고 싶지 않아!","source_cn":"我这辈子再也不想见到你了！不……我连死后也不要再见到你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94665BC972CA7D71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:罗莎":{"text":"로사","source":"罗莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:累德":{"text":"레이드","source":"累德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}